1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,770
According to Duanmu Ji,

25
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,650
this should be the gate to the first trial.

26
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,730
I have no way back...

27
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,210
I can only move forward.

28
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,450
Come out !

29
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,210
Master, I'm here !

30
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,170
Who do you want me to kill ?

31
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,170
Where are they ?

32
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,690
How many are there ?

33
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,330
Go in.

34
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,690
Are you crazy !?

35
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:13,530
You want me to go in there !?

36
00:03:14,440 --> 00:03:16,330
Who knows what's inside ?

37
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:17,650
I won't.

38
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,410
Absolutely not !

39
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,290
At worst,

40
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,610
we will just die here together.

41
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,290
A soul ?

42
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,770
I mustn't fall for it.

43
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:40,930
W...wait !

44
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,730
Fine, I'll go in...

45
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:46,610
It's yours when you come back.

46
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:48,530
Life is so unfair !

47
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,210
Master...

48
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,330
the soul...

49
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:20,450
Fire...

50
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,410
Metal...

51
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:24,290
It seems these trials are related to the 5 elements.

52
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,770
I only know the Earth Escape Technique.

53
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,730
Only in the Earth trial

54
00:04:28,480 --> 00:04:30,170
will I have an advantage.

55
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:37,090
I should just go in a few more times

56
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,290
and properly fleece that fiend !

57
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,410
As long as I keep devouring souls,

58
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:44,370
I'll be able to deal with him one day.

59
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,610
Master, another one ?

60
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,210
Thank you Master !

61
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,210
Thank you Master !

62
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:58,170
Your servant Xu Liguo is willing to serve you tirelessly

63
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:00,210
through all dangers and hardships !

64
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:13,930
Master...

65
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,770
I already gave you all I had,

66
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:20,330
you should've saved them.

67
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,410
Go back in.

68
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,290
What is this thing ?

69
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:35,370
Bastard, stop it !

70
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,610
I'll go, I'll go !

71
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:53,010
Found it !

72
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,170
This fiend

73
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,650
is working me to death !

74
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:59,210
Even if I haven't done anything, I’m still working hard !

75
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:09,650
First Trial: Earth 
Land of the Ancient God

76
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,850
It looks like

77
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,610
in order to clear this trial

78
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,050
I need to reach that gate.

79
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:23,170
It's coming...

80
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,770
This is the end !

81
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:28,530
I should have just fought him to the death !

82
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:31,130
I should've died like a man...

83
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,170
Earth Escape !

84
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:39,290
Master's plan is brilliant !

85
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:42,690
With the Earth Escape Technique in this Earth trial

86
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:44,530
you're like a fish in water !

87
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,250
You're noisy.

88
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:49,330
Master, I'm not done !

89
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:52,210
Give me another soul !

90
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,570
Heavens bless me !

91
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:59,250
Master is a living saint !

92
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:07,490
Since we have the Earth Escape Technique,

93
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:10,210
this Earth trial won't hurt me like the others.

94
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:12,410
Master,

95
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:13,770
I braved all dangers

96
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:15,010
to find this place for you !

97
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,170
Could I maybe...

98
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,530
get another reward ?

99
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:32,450
This is bad !

100
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,690
This tornado

101
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,170
is made of beasts !

102
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,970
Break !

103
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:18,210
Something's wrong.

104
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:29,610
It's time for me to shine !

105
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,330
Come back !

106
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,850
They're calling for backup !?

107
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,730
Where is their honor ?

108
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,690
We're done for...

109
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:10,210
We can't fight them !

110
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:12,290
We can't run away...

111
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,930
This black tower is strange.

112
00:09:26,160 --> 00:09:27,330
Could it be...

113
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,690
I must try.

114
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,570
Wh...What...

115
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,410
What are you doing ?

116
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:36,570
You're crazy !

117
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,450
Good,

118
00:09:58,560 --> 00:10:00,370
it's as I suspected.

119
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:01,090
This black tower

120
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,930
has a restriction to ward off the beasts.

121
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:19,210
I hope this fiend gets trapped here forever.

122
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,610
When you die,

123
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,410
I'll devour you.

124
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,370
Xu Liguo.

125
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,090
Your servant is here !

126
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,090
W...what ?

127
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:37,410
Why is he smiling ?

128
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:39,450
He...

129
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,690
is about to sacrifice me...?

130
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:49,810
Eat this.

131
00:10:50,040 --> 00:10:51,210
What ?

132
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:56,050
So it really is

133
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:59,090
my last meal...

134
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:02,850
Whatever !

135
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:04,610
I'd rather die stuffed !

136
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:06,930
Try flying over that tornado.

137
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,250
Don't fly too high.

138
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:16,170
Okay...

139
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:18,250
Watch me open a path

140
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:20,970
for you, Master !

141
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,250
I never would have thought

142
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:27,250
that you would set me free one day !

143
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:44,250
So there's also a restriction in the sky.

144
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:48,210
It's a shame I lost my devil...

145
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,850
Master !

146
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:02,210
There's a restriction in the sky

147
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,610
that prevents cheating.

148
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:04,450
But...

149
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:06,130
when I was in the tornado

150
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:08,370
I swallowed a bunch of these beasts.

151
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:11,130
Those beasts see me like mice see a cat,

152
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,970
they didn't even try to fight !

153
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:14,850
Serves them right for bullying you !

154
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:15,890
I, Xu Liguo,

155
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:17,850
have avenged you, Master.

156
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,490
They didn't attack you ?

157
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:23,530
I mean... A little bit...

158
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:26,210
but for each hit I take, I devour 2 of them.

159
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:28,370
When you devoured their souls

160
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:30,170
were they weak ?

161
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:32,050
Huh ?

162
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:34,330
Weird...

163
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:36,130
I think you're right.

164
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:40,090
Individually, these beasts are weak.

165
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:42,530
In that case,

166
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,730
if I tame a powerful one

167
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:48,610
I should be able to control a tornado.

168
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:51,850
Spit out half of the souls

169
00:12:51,880 --> 00:12:53,290
you just devoured.

170
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,290
What ?

171
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:06,210
Master, I promise I'm not lying.

172
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,770
They're all here.

173
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:22,450
What the hell is he doing ?

174
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,250
As expected,

175
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:36,890
these souls are all compatible with each other.

176
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:39,770
They're all copies of the same soul.

177
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:42,090
It's the perfect material.

178
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:45,210
He...

179
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,850
He's creating a devil !

180
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,050
No way,

181
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,450
I need to quickly absorb

182
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:52,610
the 250 souls I devoured.

183
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:54,730
Otherwise, if this new devil is stronger than me

184
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:57,290
the fiend will surely feed me to him !

185
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:58,930
Xu Liguo

186
00:13:59,240 --> 00:13:59,970
Yes !

187
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,650
Catch more souls.

188
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,370
300

189
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,810
300 ?

190
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,170
Go !

191
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:08,650
I'll go...

192
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:44,690
I did it.

193
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,770
The weak group together

194
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,850
and eventually form a tornado.

195
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:01,490
The powerful beast I created

196
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:03,370
attracts weaker beasts

197
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:05,970
to make a similar tornado.

198
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,770
Th...this...

199
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,930
Who did this ?

200
00:15:33,040 --> 00:15:35,290
The tornado was poisoned to death.

201
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:38,010
That's the work of the Soul Formation poison cultivator,

202
00:15:37,920 --> 00:15:39,410
Hunchback Meng.

203
00:16:05,240 --> 00:16:06,490
Damn it...

204
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:08,570
The more I kill, the more come.

205
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:11,050
Tell me Li Tian,

206
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:14,530
how about we have some fun together ?

207
00:16:34,400 --> 00:16:37,690
Mere Core Formation and Nascent Soul beasts...

208
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:40,490
So what if more of you are here ?

209
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:53,170
I haven't had this much fun killing in years.

210
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:55,010
Keep coming !

211
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:34,730
Count the specks of time

212
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:34,730
floating down gently.

213
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:40,970
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

214
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:48,490
Forever lock away the scars

215
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:48,490
of this mortal life.

216
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:55,010
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

217
00:17:55,400 --> 00:18:02,730
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

218
00:17:58,080 --> 00:18:02,730
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

219
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:09,890
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

220
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:09,890
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

221
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:12,410
I will ask the heavens who exactly

222
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:17,170
sliced open this world

223
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:17,170
to let the rain fall in.

224
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:19,170
I will refine the world

225
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:21,690
to make our palm lines say

226
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:24,050
that we will live forever.

227
00:18:23,800 --> 00:18:26,970
Walking off the beaten path

228
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:30,050
through heaven and earth.

229
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:37,010
Before returning to dust,

230
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:37,010
I will refine this mortal body.

231
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:45,890
The left shore is the joyous laughter

232
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:45,890
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

233
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:52,490
The right shore is an eternal silence

234
00:18:47,240 --> 00:18:52,490
lingering under the candlelight.

235
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:55,370
To overturn this fate,

236
00:18:55,120 --> 00:18:59,730
I will walk against the heavens.

237
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:06,890
I will even gather the clouds

238
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:06,890
to illuminate the sky for you.

239
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:11,130
All this sadness was not meaningless.

240
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:14,450
How many lives and deaths
have passed in the blink of an eye ?

241
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:20,250
I vow to break

242
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:20,250
this chess game of fate.

243
00:19:21,320 --> 00:19:31,210
I vow to break

244
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:31,210
this chess game of fate.
